### i18n Loader (`i18nLoader.ts`)

Internationalization and translation utilities powered by i18next.

#### Functions

- `initializeI18nextSync(): void` - Synchronously initialize i18next (called at app startup)
- `t(key: string, options?: Record<string, unknown>): string` - Translate key with optional interpolation
- `nunjucksT(key: string, options?: Record<string, unknown>): string` - Nunjucks template translation function
- `i18next` - Direct access to i18next instance for advanced usage

#### Usage

```typescript
import { t, initializeI18nextSync, i18next } from '#src/scripts/helpers/index.js';

// Initialize at app startup
initializeI18nextSync();

// Translate in TypeScript
const greeting = t('common.hello');
const message = t('pages.welcome', { name: 'John' });

// Or use in Nunjucks templates
// {{ t('common.back') }}
// {{ t('forms.name.label') }}
```

For detailed documentation, see the [Centralised Locale System](locales.html) page.

